WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:34.600
 🎵 And don't forget folks, when you goes to the polls today, a vote for Popeye means free ice cream for all the kiddies.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.540
🎵 Alright men, step right over here and get your free cigars.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:54.220
🎵 And what we need is bigger elephants in all our zoos.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:55.880
Oh my gosh.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:02.060
🎵 Now just remember your old pal Bluto at the polls today, fellas.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.720
And an extra cigar for each and every vote you give me.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.000
Yes sir.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:14.340
And furthermore, I promises two cans of spinach for every pot.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.620
Here's me past record folks, which speaks for itself.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.180
You double crosser.

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.460
Steal my voters, will you?

00:01:22.460 --> 00:02:33.430
🎵 Miss Oil, I'd like you to vote for me for president.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:43.840
If you want a good looking guy in the White House, vote for me.

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:45.400
No sooner said than shot, darling.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:03:58.350
🎵 To the polls.
